update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$The correct answer is 1/5. Since the number 5 can also be written as 5/1, the given equation can also be written as x/8 = 5/1. This equation is equivalent to 8/x = 1/5. Therefore, the value of 8/x is 1/5. Note that 1/5 and .2 are examples of ways to enter a correct answer.
