update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$The correct answer is 24. The equation 24x/ny = 4 can be rewritten as (24/n)(x/y) = 4. It's given that x/y = 4. Substituting 4 for x/y in the equation (24/n)(x/y) = 4 yields (24/n)(4) = 4. Multiplying both sides of this equation by n yields (24)(4) = 4n. Dividing both sides of this equation by 4 yields 24 = n. Therefore, the value of n is 24.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-3726e079' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = 'daf3cfdd';
