update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice A is correct. It’s given that when Tanya works z hours, she earns 13.50z dollars. Since her hourly rate is constant, if she works 3 times as many hours, or 3z hours, she will earn 3 times as many dollars, or 3(13.50z).
Choice B is incorrect. This expression represents adding 3 dollars to the 13.50z dollars Tanya will earn. Choice C is incorrect. This expression can be rewritten as 16.50z, which implies that Tanya earns $16.50 per hour, not $13.50. Choice D is incorrect. This expression adds 3 to the number of hours Tanya works, rather than multiplying the hours she works by 3.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-445dd032' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = '013fd3b2';
