update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice B is correct. It’s given that the function f is defined by f(x) = 3x - 8. The value of f(7) is the value of f(x) when x = 7. Substituting 7 for x in the given equation yields f(7) = 3(7) - 8, which is equivalent to f(7) = 21 - 8, or f(7) = 13.
Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of f(7) when f(x) = 3x + 8, rather than f(x) = 3x - 8.
Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of f(1), rather than f(7).
Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of f(-7), rather than f(7).$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-4e97f862' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = '7ee1a387';
