update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice B is correct. Subtracting the second equation, 4x - 8y = 9, from the first equation, 7x - 5y = 4, results in (7x - 5y) - (4x - 8y) = 4 - 9, or 7x - 5y - 4x + 8y = 5. Combining like terms on the left-hand side of this equation yields 3x + 3y = -5.
