update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice D is correct. Multiplying both sides of y = 2x - 3 by 5 results in 5y = 10x - 15. Multiplying both sides of 3y = 5x by 2 results in 6y = 10x. Subtracting the resulting equations yields 5y - 6y = (10x - 15) - 10x, which simplifies to -y = -15. Dividing both sides of -y = -15 by -1 results in y = 15.
Choices A and B are incorrect and may result from incorrectly subtracting the transformed equation. Choice C is incorrect and may result from finding the value of x instead of the value of y.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-5e422ff9' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = '585e668a';
