I. The median number of points per player for data set B is less than the median number of points per player for data set A.
II. The mean number of points per player for data set B is less than the mean number of points per player for data set A.$qb$, image_url = $qb$/question-figures/cb/CB-608cf8e2.png$qb$, updated_at = now() where source_ref = 'CB-608cf8e2' and left(md5(stem), 8) = 'a2db7e43';
