update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice D is correct. It’s given that the ratio of t to u is 1 to 2. Since t = 10, it follows that the ratio of 10 to u is also 1 to 2. The relationship between these ratios can be represented by the proportion 10/u = 1/2. Multiplying both sides of this equation by 2 and then by u yields 20 = u.
Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of u when t = 1. Choice B is incorrect. This would be the value of u if the ratio of t to u were 2 to 1. Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of t, not u.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-6310adbc' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = 'bfd5a1c9';
