update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice C is correct. Using the quadratic formula to solve the given expression yields x = (-(-1) ± √((-1)^(2) - 4(1)(-1)))/(2(1)) = (1 ± √5)/2. Therefore, x = (1 + √5)/2 and x = (1 - √5)/2 satisfy the given equation.
