update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice D is correct. The range of a data set is the difference between the maximum and the minimum values in the set. The maximum value among the high temperatures in the table is 82°F and the minimum value is 80°F. Therefore, the range is 82°F – 80°F = 2°F.
