Choice B is incorrect. This represents 9% of x. Choice C is incorrect. This represents increasing x by 9, not by 9%. Choice D is incorrect. This represents increasing x by 0.09, not by 9%.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-8a714fa1' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = '388b8d51';
