update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice B is correct. Solving the given equation for Q gives the quantity of the product sold in terms of P and T. Dividing both sides of the given equation by P yields T/P = Q, or Q = T/P. Therefore, Q = T/P gives the quantity of product sold in terms of P and T.
Choice A is incorrect and may result from an error when dividing both sides of the given equation by P. Choice C is incorrect and may result from multiplying, rather than dividing, both sides of the given equation by P. Choice D is incorrect and may result from subtracting P from both sides of the equation rather than dividing both sides by P.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-98f735f2' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = '3867fea9';
