update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice D is correct. The value of f(x) when x = -8 can be found by substituting -8 for x in the given function. This yields f(-8) = -3(-8) + 60, or f(-8) = 84. Therefore, when x = -8, the value of f(x) is 84.
Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of (-3 + (-8)) + 60, not -3(-8) + 60.
Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of -8 + 60, not -3(-8) + 60.
Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of -3 + 60, not -3(-8) + 60.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-a232aa96' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = '084e2b25';
