update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice D is correct. The expression (a + b/2)^(2) can be rewritten as (a + b/2) (a + b/2). Using the distributive property, the expression yields (a + b/2) (a + b/2) = a^(2) + ab/2 + ab/2 + b^(2)/4. Combining like terms gives a^(2) + ab + b^(2)/4.
Choices A, B, and C are incorrect and may result from errors using the distributive property on the given expression or combining like terms.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-ad038c19' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = 'aac79ee6';
