update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice C is correct. The table gives the results of 200 people who were asked how often they see a movie in a theater. The table shows that 29 people responded “never” and 53 people responded “almost never.” Therefore, 29 + 53, or 82, people responded either “never” or “almost never.”
