Choice A is incorrect because this describes the value 30. Choice B is incorrect because 30 represents the length of the spring before it has been stretched. Choice C is incorrect because this describes the value w.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-daad7c32' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = '7a62caf7';
