update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$Choice C is correct. The mean of the four scores (G, 85, 78, and 98) can be expressed as (G + 85 + 78 + 98)/4. The inequality that expresses the condition that the mean score is at least 90 can therefore be written as (G + 85 + 78 + 98)/4 ≥ 90.
