I. The median number of bursts
II. The mean number of bursts$qb$, image_url = $qb$/question-figures/cb/CB-e7d48c8a.png$qb$, updated_at = now() where source_ref = 'CB-e7d48c8a' and left(md5(stem), 8) = 'a2db7e43';
