update question_keys k set explanation = $qb$The correct answer is 130. It’s given that 8x - 7x + 130 = 260. Combining like terms on the left-hand side of this equation yields x + 130 = 260. Subtracting 130 from each side of this equation yields x = 130. Therefore, the value of x that's the solution to the given equation is 130.$qb$ from questions q where q.id = k.question_id and q.source_ref = 'CB-f2b63f49' and left(md5(q.stem), 8) = '37cedf52';
